==============================================================================
Completing the square check (-u^2/2-uz) - (-(u+z)^2/2+z^2/2) = 0  -> PASS
Direct sympy evaluation of int_0^inf e^{-u^2/2-uz}du = sqrt(2)*sqrt(pi)*exp(zz**2/2)*erfc(sqrt(2)*zz/2)/2
Claimed closed form  sqrt(pi/2)*e^{z^2/2}*erfc(z/sqrt2)      = sqrt(2)*sqrt(pi)*exp(zz**2/2)*erfc(sqrt(2)*zz/2)/2
Difference: 0  -> PASS
(Note: sqrt(pi/2)*e^{z^2/2}*erfc(z/sqrt2) IS erfcx(z/sqrt2)*sqrt(pi/2)
 by definition erfcx(w):=e^{w^2}erfc(w), w=z/sqrt2, w^2=z^2/2 -- matches
 the record's own R(z)=sqrt(pi/2)*erfcx(z/sqrt2) exactly.)

